{"status":true,"data":{"id":281,"name":"Red Uncensor","slug":"red-uncensor","mod_id":"RedUncensor","shortDescription":"Allows you to hide clothing and armor on enemy npcs.","description":"Perhaps you don't want to slay cannibals, but \"Observe\" them I won't judge. We all have our vices. At any rate this mod hides clothing on most cannibals. It has config options for most cannibals so if you only want clothing to be hidden from specific cannibals it can do that. \r\n\r\nYou can also choose between armor and clothing. Yes they are different in so far as the game is concerned. \r\n\r\nThis mod has no effect on Virginia or Kelvin. If you want to see Virginia naked, use Virginia Customizations Expanded. \r\n\r\nhttps://www.nexusmods.com/sonsoftheforest/mods/144?tab=description\r\n\r\nMultiplayer:\r\n\r\nWorks based on the hosts settings for clients.","dependencies":"","type":"Mod","modSide":"server","isNSFW":true,"isApproved":true,"isFeatured":false,"isMultiplayerCompatible":false,"requiresAllPlayers":false,"lastWeekDownloads":46,"downloads":2247,"latestVersion":"1.0.4","latestVersionSize":"","averageRating":0,"reviewsCount":0,"favoritesCount":2,"commentsCount":0,"sourceUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1766827348890_RedUncensor.png","buildGuid":null,"buildShareVersion":null,"numberOfElements":null,"lastReleasedAt":"2026-01-14T21:24:20.475Z","createdAt":"2025-12-27T09:22:31.703Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-29T03:30:00.368Z","userId":413,"categoryId":1,"images":[{"url":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1766827349650_2025-12-27 04_08_13-Discord Overlay.png"},{"url":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1766827349777_2025-12-27 04_08_04-Discord Overlay.png"},{"url":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1766827349903_2025-12-27 03_39_44-Discord Overlay.png"}],"user":{"name":"RegiToXic","slug":"regitoxic","imageUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1766549148234_413_avatar.png","isTrusted":true},"category":{"name":"Misc","slug":"misc"},"versions":[{"id":650,"version":"1.0.4","isLatest":true,"changelog":"Fi